+- Dormancy, the idle waits and the working cap: [Servex/doc/dormant.md](/Servex/doc/dormant.md)
+- Tests: `node Servex/agents/compact-before-sleep.test.mjs`, `node Servex/agents/compact-nudge.test.mjs`
