++# Servex: compact before sleep
++
++**Source:** the owner's prompt `e008bc50-aaf1-4c3d-8f68-5cf167b87df6` in [`../../prompts.jsonl`](../../prompts.jsonl), routed by vscode-mastermind to mastermind-system-architect-3 (2026-10-23).
